That ain't hungry.
That's famine.

40
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.400
Usually happens when you cross a desert
on the run.

41
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.500
Yeah. and whoever crosses a desert fast...

42
00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:05.900
got somethin' gnawin' on his conscience.
huh?

43
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.900
Right.

44
