Your plan worked like a miracle.

1265
01:40:44.100 --> 01:40:45.900
Well. Sheriff!

1266
01:40:46.000 --> 01:40:49.300
This-this really is very embarrassing.

1267
01:40:49.400 --> 01:40:51.700
Have you seen what faith can do?

1268
01:40:51.800 --> 01:40:55.300
It'll work.
if you put it in a rifle barrel.

1269
01:40:56.400 --> 01:40:58.500
Well. I guess that's it.

1270
01:40:58.800 --> 01:41:01.900
For the moment.
but this won't end here.

1271
01:41:02.300 --> 01:41:03.600
Oh. yeah?

1272
01:41:03.800 --> 01:41:05.900
No. Major. it ends here.

1273
01:41:09.000 --> 01:41:11.300
It's gotta end here.

1274
01:41:34.600 --> 01:41:37.500
"The words of Choheleth. son of David...

1275
01:41:37.600 --> 01:41:40.700
"King of Jerusalem."
Your hat. please.

1276
01:41:40.800 --> 01:41:43.900
"There's a time to be born
and a time to die."

1277
01:41:44.400 --> 01:41:46.500
- Yeah.
- "To love and to hate."

1278
01:41:46.700 --> 01:41:48.400
"There is a time to..."

1279
01:41:48.900 --> 01:41:51.000
brothers. it says here...

1280
01:41:51.100 --> 01:41:53.200
