1281
01:41:53.400 --> 01:41:54.900
Win. brothers!

1282
01:42:01.000 --> 01:42:02.300
Go and fight!
Go on!

1283
01:47:41.600 --> 01:47:43.700
Let me... let me help you.

1284
01:47:45.800 --> 01:47:47.800
