1285
01:47:47.900 --> 01:47:49.800
Load up the horses
and let's get outta here.

1286
01:47:49.900 --> 01:47:51.500
Okay.

1287
01:47:56.700 --> 01:47:57.500
All right. the valley is yours...

1288
01:47:57.600 --> 01:47:59.300
