- The ones you stole from me.

1290
01:48:02.400 --> 01:48:03.900
Hey. watch what you're sayin'. Major.

1291
01:48:04.000 --> 01:48:06.400
You're horse thieves. and you know it.

1292
01:48:07.700 --> 01:48:10.500
One thing about that Major...
he never lies.

1293
01:48:10.800 --> 01:48:13.700
Major. you ever been to Nebraska?

1294
01:48:17.000 --> 01:48:20.300
I heard there's some beautiful
pastures there.

1295
01:48:25.800 --> 01:48:30.100
That. uh. idea about Nebraska
doesn't sound too bad.

1296
01:48:45.000 --> 01:48:48.400
Hey. Major. Nebraska is that a-way.

1297
01:49:00.500 --> 01:49:02.700
- Thank you. oh. Lo...
