1317
01:50:11.000 --> 01:50:14.600
your sisters. your brothers.
your ancestors. your cows...

1318
01:50:14.700 --> 01:50:17.400
and everything.

1319
01:50:17.500 --> 01:50:18.900
Oh.

1320
01:50:24.600 --> 01:50:27.200
This is just my luck.
Hah!

1321
01:50:48.400 --> 01:50:50.500
