- Oh. yeah.

1322
01:51:01.800 --> 01:51:05.600
Oh. Lord. to your glory.
we raise our chalice of love.

1323
01:51:06.300 --> 01:51:08.600
Take into your fold this lost sheep...

1324
01:51:09.100 --> 01:51:12.200
who in penitence.
has thrown his weapons of evil...

1325
01:51:12.300 --> 01:51:15.500
