1328
01:51:20.400 --> 01:51:22.500
Accept him back into
the light of your spirit.

1329
01:51:23.800 --> 01:51:27.400
He shall labor 'til he grows weary
with fatigue.

1330
01:51:27.500 --> 01:51:30.000
He shall irrigate these vast fields...

1331
01:51:30.200 --> 01:51:33.100
