the travails of his life on earth.

1339
01:51:52.000 --> 01:51:55.200
We thank thee for the many blessings
you have bestowed upon us...

1340
01:51:55.300 --> 01:51:58.500
and hope always to be worthy of your love.

1341
01:51:58.600 --> 01:52:00.700
- Amen.
- Amen.

